DD-L028 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L028)

  × `050` has a leading zero: octal in YAML 1.1, decimal in YAML 1.2
    ╭─[55-L028-leading-zero.yaml:32:17]
 31 │       celsius: { cel: "double(raw) / 100.0", unit: Cel }
 32 │     timeout_ms: 050
    ·                 ─┬─
    ·                  ╰── ambiguous number
 33 │     retries: 2
    ╰────
  help: write `50` for decimal or `0o50` for octal
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[55-L028-leading-zero.yaml:41:1]
 40 │     timeout_ms: 50
 41 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 42 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
